2. STAGE 1 OBJECTIVES

Implement the following five interconnected modules:

1. EVENTRA MANAGE
2. EVENTRA DISCOVER
3. EVENTRA EVENT PAGES
4. EVENTRA INVITE
5. EVENTRA REGISTER

These features must work together through a shared event management foundation.

